                                    <span class="dics-kb-eyebrow">HOW ODOO WORKS</span>
                                    <h2>How Does Odoo Work?</h2>
                                    <p>
                                        Odoo is built using technologies such as Python and PostgreSQL.
                                        You do not need to understand the technical side to use Odoo, but the technology behind Odoo makes it possible to add apps, customize business processes, and connect Odoo with other software.
                                    </p>

                                    <div class="dics-kb-pillars">
