                                                    Python is used for Odoo's business logic and server-side features.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </article>
                                        <article>
                                            <span>02</span>
                                            <div>
                                                <h3>PostgreSQL</h3>
                                                <p>Odoo uses PostgreSQL to store business information —
                                                    customers, products, sales orders, invoices, inventory, employees, and more.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </article>
                                        <article>
                                            <span>03</span>
                                            <div>
                                                <h3>Customization</h3>
                                                <p>Odoo can be customized to match specific business requirements.
                                                    Add custom fields, workflows, reports, modules, and integrations without changing the main Odoo code directly.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </article>
                                    </div>
